            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya majambo n’amwe n’ayo mu cete canditswe na Tatenayi, icēgēra c’umwami co hakuno y’ uruzi, na Shetari‐bozenayi, na bagenzi babo b’Abafarisaki baba hakuno y’uruzi, bakakirungikira umwami Dariyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bamurungikira icete canditswe girtya, ngo Ku mwami Dariyo, n’ amahoro neza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urazirikanye ga mugenzi, twagiye mu gihugu c’i Buyuda ku nzu y’Imana nkuru yubakishwa amabuye manini‐manini, kand’ itambitswekw ibiti ku nsika zayo; ico gikorwa kirakomeza kuja imbere, bafise amaboko yabakundiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 4:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None twabajije abo bakuru, tuti Ni nde yabahaye ibgirizwa ryo kwubaka iyi nzu, ngo mwuzuze n’uru ruzitiro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi twababajije amazina yabo, kugira ngo tuyakumenyeshe, twandika n’amazina y’abakuru babagaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
