        },
        {
          "text": "Bat’ Ariko hanyuma ba sogokuruza baratsa Imana Nyen’ ijuru, ibatanga mu maboko ya Nebukadineza w’Umukaludaya, umwami w’i Babuloni, ni we yasanganguye iyo ngoro, ajana abantu i Babuloni ar’ inyagano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
