            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bati Mbere n’ibikoreshwa vy’izahabu n’ifeza vyahora mur’ iyo ngoro y’Imana, ivyo Nebukadineza yari yarasahuye muri yo, ari rwo rusengero rwahora hano i Yerusalemu, akabijana mu rusengero rw’i Babuloni, bat’ Umwami Kuro abikūra mur’ urwo rusengero rw’i Babuloni nyene, bishikirizwa umuntu yitwa Sheshibazari, uwo yari yaragize icēgēra ciwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bat’ Aramubgira, at’ Abīra ivyo bintu ubijane ku kibanza c’urusengero rw’i Yerusalemu, iyo nzu y’Imana isubire yubakwe mu kibanza cayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
