              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bukeye uwo Sheshibazari araza, yubaka itanguriro ry’iyo nzu y’Imana i Yerusalemu nyene. Nuko rer’ uhereye ico gihe ugashitsa n’ubu iracubakwa, kandi ntiruzura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.16",
